# Docker build context: monorepo root (npm workspaces, ADR-0009).
# Everything not needed to build an image is excluded.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.expo
**/web-build
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.vscode
.claude
docs

# Secrets: never baked into an image, passed at runtime
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/npm-debug.*
**/.DS_Store
